  "solution": "Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (1).<br>Xét phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, chia hai vế phương trình cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math>) ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTừ (1) suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>\\</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mfrac display